#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:24
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt14Intro"
msgid ""
"What, what, what?\p"
"Only TEAM MAGMA members are supposed\n"
"to be in here!\p"
"But you're not dressed in TEAM MAGMA's\n"
"uniform…\p"
"You rouse my suspicion!\n"
"Battle with me!$"
msgstr ""
"什么什么什么？\p"
"这里只有熔岩队的成员才能进来！\p"
"可是你没有穿熔岩队的制服……\p"
"你很可疑！和我对战！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:33
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt14Defeat"
msgid ""
"Aiyiyi…\n"
"My pride as a TEAM MAGMA member…$"
msgstr ""
"哎呀呀……\n"
"我身为熔岩队成员的尊严……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:37
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt14PostBattle"
msgid ""
"If you suffer from chills, you should\n"
"join TEAM MAGMA.$"
msgstr "如果你怕冷的话，就该加入熔岩队。$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:41
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt3Intro"
msgid ""
"Hold it right there!\p"
"You don't really expect me to keep\n"
"my trap shut and let you waltz by me?$"
msgstr ""
"站住！\p"
"你不会真的以为我会闭上嘴，\n"
"让你大摇大摆地走过去吧？$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt3Defeat"
msgid ""
"Ooh wow!\n"
"I concede!$"
msgstr "哦哇！我认输！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:50
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt3PostBattle"
msgid ""
"Maybe it would've been better if I did\n"
"just let you go unchallenged…$"
msgstr "也许我刚才直接放你过去会比较好……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:54
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt4Intro"
msgid ""
"Ahah!\n"
"An intruder!$"
msgstr "啊哈！有入侵者！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:58
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt4Defeat"
msgid "Graaah!$"
msgstr "呃啊啊！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:61
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt4PostBattle"
msgid ""
"I've already lost.\p"
"Do I really need to keep running\n"
"around in a circle?$"
msgstr ""
"我已经输了。\p"
"我真的还要继续绕着圈跑吗？$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:66
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt5Intro"
msgid ""
"Oh, oh!\n"
"An intruder!$"
msgstr "哦，哦！有入侵者！$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:70
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt5Defeat"
msgid "Mutter…$"
msgstr "嘟囔……$"

#: data/maps/MagmaHideout_2F_1R/scripts.inc:73
msgctxt "MagmaHideout_2F_1R_Text_Grunt5PostBattle"
msgid "Actually, I'm no expert at battling…$"
msgstr "其实，我并不擅长对战……$"
